      "summary": "Heat moves energy into food and changes its structure.",
      "tier": "core",
      "reason": "Needed for every practical exam question.",
      "detail": "## Why heat matters\n\nHeat changes `proteins` and starches.",
      "detailHtml": "<h2>Why heat matters</h2><p>Heat changes <code>proteins</code> and starches. See the <span class=\"internal-link\">Maillard note</span> and <a href=\"https://example.org/heat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">an outside article</a>.</p><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table><thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Temp (C)</th><th>Time</th><th>Notes</th><th>Notes 2</th><th>Notes 3</th><th>Notes 4</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Steam</td><td>100</td><td>10 min</td><td>Gentle, keeps shape and colour of the vegetables</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr><tr><td>Roast</td><td>200</td><td>25 min</td><td>Browning from the Maillard reaction</td><td>-</td><td>-</td><td>-</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"tip\" class=\"callout\"><div class=\"callout-title\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-flame\"><path d=\"M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.07-2.14-.22-4.05 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.15.43-2.29 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Tip</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\"><p>Salt the water <strong>before</strong> it boils.</p></div></div><p>Flow of a meal:</p><div class=\"mermaid\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 60\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"flow\"><style>.n{fill:#8a5cf5;opacity:.18;stroke:#8a5cf5}.t{font:12px sans-serif;fill:currentColor}</style><rect class=\"n\" x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"14\" y=\"33\">Start</text><path d=\"M62 28h40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\"/><rect class=\"n\" x=\"102\" y=\"12\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\"/><text class=\"t\" x=\"118\" y=\"33\">Heat</text><path d=\"M16